loto.lt – populiariausių loterijų Lietuvoje mobilioji programėlė.
Jūsų patogumui:
•	Tikrink loterijų bilietus;
•	Surask artimiausią „Perlo“ terminalą;
•    Gauk informaciją apie laimėjimus;

Mes visada laukiame jūsų atsiliepimų! Jei turite idėjų, kaip patobulinti programėlę, rašykite mums: info@loto.lt.

Alice Player is IPTV Ott Player
Allows you to view IPTV playlists from any provider
Breathe new life into your iPad, iPhone or Apple TV box!
Peculiarities:
- Any number of playlists in m3u or X-Tream Codes formats;
- Simple and intuitive interface;
- Automatic synchronization;
- Support for any program guide sources and their automatic updating;
- Favorites and history;
- Search;
- Sorting;
- Support for archives;
- And many many others...
At the moment the player is in beta status.

This is the basic version of the player and it's free for now!
Over time, Alice Player will have new features and at some point this application will become paid.
In the meantime, enjoy!

IMPORTANT!
"Alice Player" does not contain links, playlists, content or anything similar that could violate the rights of third parties."
"Alice Player" does not provide you with ready-made playlists and links to them. You can find playlists from your TV service provider or online!
